<title>USA: TABLE - Fidelity Bancorp Q3 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Fidelity Bancorp Q3 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					    June 30,	  June, 30</p>
<p>				   1997	  1996	1997    1996</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses  130	    90	 365     180</p>
<p> Net Interest Income	2,405	 2,339     7,107   6,475</p>
<p>Gain (loss) on sale</p>
<p>  of securities		   6	    10	  27	27</p>
<p> Net income		     656	   617     1,916   1,553</p>
<p>Primary earnings per share</p>
<p>				   0.41     0.40	   1.21    1.01</p>
<p>		     (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Fidelity Bancorp Inc said its third quarter period ended June 30.</p>
<p>Earnings per share for the third quarter and first nine months of 1997 have been restated to reflect the 10 percent common stock dividend paid in May 1997.</p>
